# XenForo tiers of bench-xf-php-series.sh (loopback-tiers.sh TIERS_FILE).
# label|url|cookie|marker|cache  -  url @NAME = /root/audit/cookies/NAME.url (seed-xf.sh);
# cookie = cookies.tsv key or =literal; marker must be in the gate response;
# cache = the X-Cache-Status the gate requires (scn h5bp/php_xf.conf), with
# wrk's own headers: HIT after one priming request, BYPASS for PHP-rendered tiers.
# T2: a session cookie bypasses the guest cache ($xf_guest_cookie in scn
# http.d/fastcgi_cache.conf matches "_session="), so PHP renders the guest page.
T1 guest cached /|https://xf.test.local/||id="XF"|HIT
T2 guest uncached /|https://xf.test.local/|=xf_session=bench-bypass|data-logged-in="false"|BYPASS
T3 member forum index|https://xf.test.local/|xf-member|data-logged-in="true"|BYPASS
T4 member median thread|@xf-thread|xf-member|data-logged-in="true"|BYPASS
